 839→+		Short: "Attach an existing agent session",
 840→+		Long: `Attach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.
 841→+
 842→+This creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and registers the
 843→+session for future tracking. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't
 844→+installed when the session started.
 845→+
 846→+Supported agents: claude-code, gemini, opencode, cursor, copilot-cli, factoryai-droid`,
 847→+		Args: cobra.ExactArgs(1),
 848→+		RunE: func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string) error {
 849→+			if checkDisabledGuard(cmd.Context(), cmd.OutOrStdout()) {
 850→+				return nil
